  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/3D_Redstone/BH_3D_Redstone_header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">这个资源包将《我的世界》中与红石相关的方块和功能组件改为了3D风格。它增强了红石粉、中继器、比较器、铁轨、活塞、熔炉、发射器等相关方块的立体感与细节。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">这些纹理的设计师是 Ferrum。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/3D_Redstone/BH_3D_Redstone_description.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">我们的目标是让红石装置和机械在保持原版《我的世界》风格的同时，看起来更具视觉吸引力。这是一个简单的视觉升级，能提升清晰度并让技术建筑更加突出，且完全不会改变游戏玩法。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/3D_Redstone/BH_3D_Redstone_faq.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>它能在服务器上运行吗？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">当然！完美兼容！请记住，与好友一起游玩模组的最佳选择是 BisectHosting，通过<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此链接即可享受25%折扣</a></strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>这个资源包可以用于整合包中吗？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然可以！只要该资源包仅在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上发布即可。上传至任何其他平台均属于侵犯我们权益的行为，是完全禁止的。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不过，如果您考虑将其加入您的 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 整合包，我们将不胜感激。如需任何微调或有任何疑问，欢迎随时联系我们！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/3D_Redstone/BH_3D_Redstone_screenshots.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1675/965/3d-redstone-1-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1621\" height=\"912\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1675/964/3d-redstone-2-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1621\" height=\"912\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1675/966/3d-redstone-3-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1621\" height=\"912\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要服务器才能和朋友一起玩吗？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/3D_Redstone/BH_3D_Redstone_promo2.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您正在寻找一个能与好友一起游玩任何模组或整合包的服务器，<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong></span> 将是您的最佳选择！他们提供性价比极高的《我的世界》服务器，并且如果您点击<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此链接</